File: contrib/libtests/makepng.c
Line: 1600
Function: strstash_list
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: malloc is not checked for failure; if malloc returns NULL, the subsequent memcpy(bar, *line++, foo) writes via a NULL pointer, causing a crash.

